{"id":"n18396-1-8","stage":1,"title":"고프다 · 饿","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n18396-1-8-1","ko":"너 왜 이렇게 힘이 없어 보이니?","zh":"你为什么看起来这么没精神啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么。","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"这样","explanation":"이렇다：这样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"이렇다","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71157","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이렇게","audio":"/audio/9a767a1c9118d82c3af9.mp3"}},{"text":"힘이","meaning":"力量，力气","explanation":"힘：力量，力气；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"힘","audio":"/audio/68de24edc341fabd21d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28633","senseId":"1","lemma":"힘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"힘이","audio":"/audio/748f97ff6aa7a31c4ea0.mp3"}},{"text":"없어","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"1","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없어","audio":"/audio/d3275bf98baed4550c12.mp3"}},{"text":"보이니?","meaning":"看起来，看上去","explanation":"보이다：看起来，看上去；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"보이다","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62091","senseId":"4","lemma":"보이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보이니","audio":"/audio/ef81d90c5f513f5194d9.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"c2f95cfd19c5a89b","term":"이렇다","zh":"这样","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3","entryId":"71157","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["이러타"]},{"id":"68de24edc341fabd","term":"힘","zh":"力量，力气","audio":"/audio/68de24edc341fabd21d4.mp3","entryId":"28633","definition":"人或动物自己运动或使其他事物移动的肌肉作用。","pronunciation":["힘"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"人或事物等实际上不存在。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]},{"id":"da6f27438e6f345c","term":"보이다","zh":"看起来，看上去","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3","entryId":"62091","definition":"认为或判断出某对象怎样。","pronunciation":["보이다"]}],"audio":"/audio/730316f4f9914f42e4f0.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n18396-1-8-2","ko":"하루 종일 굶어서 배가 고파서 그래.","zh":"因为一整天都没吃东西，所以饿了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"하루","meaning":"一天","explanation":"하루：一天。","readings":[{"term":"하루","audio":"/audio/621a158068fae5de1aee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49315","senseId":"1","lemma":"하루","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하루","audio":"/audio/621a158068fae5de1aee.mp3"}},{"text":"종일","meaning":"整天，一天到晚","explanation":"종일：整天，一天到晚。","readings":[{"term":"종일","audio":"/audio/02f69fc1875bf3107006.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91758","senseId":"1","lemma":"종일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"종일","audio":"/audio/02f69fc1875bf3107006.mp3"}},{"text":"굶어서","meaning":"饿，饿肚子","explanation":"굶다：饿，饿肚子；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"굶다","audio":"/audio/ca69cd5a47a504db8094.